Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Henry Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲 我的祖父 都是学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, his father before him were both Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you guys were such a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们从来没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why haven't we ever heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Josie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉我这个入会仪式这么隆重\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told me this initiation was a formal affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,最艰难的时候已经过去了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hard part's over, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对1958年\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者大屠杀知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of letters' massacre, 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大步挺进地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll march into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔崛起 大放光彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And demon kind will rise up and.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,横扫世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep over the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让Crowley管事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put Crowley in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的王已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是女王万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道Abaddon和Cain之间的纠葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about Abaddon and Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you played me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们欠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我变成瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的王国土崩瓦解之时把我关在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep me stashed away for months while my kingdom falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,近在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the object of your quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把初刃放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就先拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hang on to old donkey teeth here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们找到Abaddon了再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until such time as you locate Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（米尔顿市 伊利诺伊州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll tell you one of the things I really love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tour Angle 144的一点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the Tour Angle 144.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a lot of you out there that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,会经常有翻倒这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have something called the chipping yips.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们并不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not proud of having them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人甚至连说都不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people don't really wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您没碰上过这种事情 那就偷着乐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't have them, be glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们 这件产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, this product.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on the menu tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meat loaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又吃肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不应该抱怨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我每天上班多辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how hard I work all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你还说三道四的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you criticise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们今晚就吃肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yes, we're having meat loaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,配土豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}With potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,西兰花\N{\fnArial\fs30}And broccoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lots of good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚有休息过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You catch any shut-eye last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm driving then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving where.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在网上无意间找到一件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught wind of a case online.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小学一年级的老师回家杀了她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}First grade teacher came home and killed her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她气过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe she snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子有一种让人变得狂躁的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ankle biters can do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把她丈夫砸成了肉块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, she pounded him into ground chunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess, possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么还不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我也想找到Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, I wanna find Abaddon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们已经查了好几天了 还是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, we've been combing through these stuffs for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许漏查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起坐在这儿 我们可以把时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're better ways to spend our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用在其他 - 也许我们没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Than spend our - Maybe we don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你杀了Magnus之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, because ever since you killed Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就变得有些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been acting…sorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,入魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为我想了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe because I want an end all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许因为 如果我们找到Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because if we find Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley就会送上初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Crowley ponies up the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能两个都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we kill her, end him, both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你说的入魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you called being obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说是工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我就只是 看看你好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm just…checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现什么了告诉我一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me up if you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的报告里说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here in your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是第一批到现场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the first on scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时Young女士就坐在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found Mrs.Young sitting next to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她丈夫尸体旁边 全身都是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her husband covered in his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她丈夫虐待她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, was her husband abusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rick吗 不 完全不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候是挺混账的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be a stubborn ass sob but.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他的吗 其他你能想到的很奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?Weird that maybe you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,写不进报告的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was too odd to include.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如什么 - 比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like - Like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell of sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会有硫磺的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I smell sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那Karen的眼睛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about…Karen's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有发现什么可疑之处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed anything strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually agent, they.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们看上去就像是人类的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much look like eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Karen和Rick是这世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen and Rick were two of most ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最普通的普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd ever meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 案发那天都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she…go anywhere on the day of the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天是周六\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了一趟杂货店 然后就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick trip to the grocery store, it's about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Manson太太还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Mrs.Manson doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,注 Charles Manson美国著名连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}在上个世纪70年代领导类似人民公社的Manson Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱里上吊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead, hung herself on the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔冒出去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon smoke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺 EMF指数也没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sulfur, no EMF anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀人前 所有见过她的人都说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who saw her just before she gutted her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有任何不正常的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she was totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还在那儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you still doing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看就是一个疯婆娘而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like the case of craziness to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是到早上没其他事 我就回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If nothing kicks by morning, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查的怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's research going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把印记给你 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's what truly you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能用这个杀那婊子吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I use it to kill that bitch - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个印记 随之而来的还有巨大的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the mark comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it up to you.Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 我正急着赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get there, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是出来之前我跟我老妈吵了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got into a fight with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got to bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一辆小货车停下来愿意载我一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a van's pulling up and let me roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我没发现这是你的车 Richie先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I don't know this is your ride, Mr.Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you out of the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面真是冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你 你 你干什么 离我远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what…what…what're you doing, get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣博纳文图尔修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St Bonaventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 RJ\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, RJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要什么别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything else, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is great.Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会来找你 Bill\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be with you in a minute, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道是在牲畜棚里长大的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mother raise you in a barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的工作很累人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给你气受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's eating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.My Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy Billy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上给你妈打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call your Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have her come and fetch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说一下具体情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还指望你告诉我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hopping that you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你先说起奇怪的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one mentioned weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都从哪儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where did they all come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是本地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are all locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个最正常不过的普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four of the straightest arrows you'd ever meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他们这样不是一天两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently they've been acting like this for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的履历有什么共性吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they share anyting in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去同一个教堂 学校 读书会什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Church, school, eh…bookclub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这孩子的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met the kid's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他当时在搭便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said he was hitching a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后上了一辆小货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a van picked him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就知道这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last she's heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever that's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么 Billy\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there's a why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我就是想这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.It's because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.13,0:10:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂货店的监控资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grocery store surveillance pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么久才接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that took forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好说 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有好几个人开始发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handful of other people have started acting out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acting out how.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个女人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well same as the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别暴力 有攻击性 易冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agressive, violent and impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进了健身房了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you're in a gold's gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过更少类固醇 更像是本性如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except it's less steroid induced, more basic instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡毛蒜皮的小事就能把他们点着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like little things can set them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我那时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个没人性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got no instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是病得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you are seriously messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灵魂的时候 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, souless me.Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我怎么忘得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how can I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.81,0:11:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不像这些人 你没有彻底失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you weren't out of control like these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不同的人丢了魂儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe everyone has different reactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应也不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they are losing their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.11,0:11:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crossroads demon making deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,提前收账来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And taking people' souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些疯子也没人之前中过大乐透啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it's not as if there people are winning a lotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's my best swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的希望你来帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can really use your help down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I…I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快找到了 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting close, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能现在就放弃抓Abaddon的大好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't drop the ball on Abaddon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟Sam扯谎的时候 就像背着老婆在外偷情的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are lying to Sam like he's your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得我成了你的小三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which kind of makes me your mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen to me young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些恶魔们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those demons are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,往事重演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上着手处理恶魔事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to take care of those demons right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要送您回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you want a ride home or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忽悠我 你这个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't patronize me you little turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 这事交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I can take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Leiter探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.69,0:12:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我讲讲这些恶魔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me all there demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wilkinson女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Wilkinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请叫我Julia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.Call me Julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很简单 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very simple, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以前来过米尔顿市\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came to Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说恶魔的时候 你眼睛都不眨一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say demons and you don't bat an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这里的其他人都觉得我一定是老年痴呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When everyone else around here thinks I'm nuts on toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我比其他人思路更开阔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm just a bit more open-minded than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们是一类人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one of them, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 他们是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, one of who.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在1958年来过米尔顿市\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came here in 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者们 来这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters…came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候一切都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was different, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真是可爱的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were a lovely couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julia修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请开一下门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please answer the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mother Superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sisiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是宗教裁判所的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here from the Office of Inquisition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想问你呢 Romeo\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你打电话叫我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你手机自动拨了我的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You butt-dialed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the hell that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何 你废话完了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 既然我来了 上次我们聊天的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, long as I'm here, last time we chitchatted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一致同意 由你去找那个红毛小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed you were gonna line up Carrot Top.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊没错 我正在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非Abaddon爱逛小酒馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless Abaddon likes ten cent wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃廉价啤酒炸鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stale beer and the clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你在这儿是找不到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我叫出来 又想甩掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me, you hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找Abaddon 又躲着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Abaddon.You don't want Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿想要初刃 一会儿又不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the Blade.You don't want the Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是认识这么久了 我会怀疑你在拖延时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know you any better, I'd say you're stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说实话 我不告诉别人 你用初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just between us girls, how did you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,削掉Magnus脑袋的时候是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you sunk the First Blade into Magnus' head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有砍你脑袋来得爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not half as good as I'm gonna feel when it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拐弯抹角骂人的样子最可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love it when you talk it dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得自己瞬间变强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you felt powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳刚之气暴增\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时内心滋生恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在诈骗大师面前班门弄斧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scam a scam artist, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拖时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用的是假名字 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave false names but.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久后我知道了那个男人叫Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later I learned that the man's name was Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Henry Winchester吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚他的姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never got last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那个女人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Josie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 算是吧 这有点难解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, sort of, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前可是个修女 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an ex-nun, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释不清简直就是我的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complicated is my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们来是为了调查什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what were they here to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了Mary Catherine修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了两个人然后从钟楼下跳下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed two people before jumping from the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我带他们去见了修道院院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I took them to see Mother Superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Agnes修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sister Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间紧迫 院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is of the essence, Mother…Superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教明早第一件事就是要见神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cardinal's meeting with the holy father first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要这件事情的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wants a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仁爱的修道院欢迎你们的神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our beloved abbey opened to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julia修女会是你们的向导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Julia here will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想从哪里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you like to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请带我们去Mary Catherine修女的睡房吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Catherine sleeping quarters, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从Mary Catherine修女的房间开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Catherine's room it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 就因为她回答了我 而不回答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, because she answered me and not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为我上的是天主教学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because I went to Catholic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我积怨已久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a lot of pent-up-anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是诉苦的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time for such pettiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么紧张兮兮的是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What got all your boxers in such a bundle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个 为什么我们要在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, why are we out in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做边干边学\N{\fnArial\fs30}This called learning on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你明明知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know damn well this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们成为正式成员前的最后一个任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last assignment before we are full members.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There lies the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们正式入会的日期越来越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}As our initiation grows closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心这次行动会变成一次自私的莽撞之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worry this might be a selfish endeavor on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,自私 怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selfish, how.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我真的出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything would happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,John和Millie怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about John, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会为你接受使命而感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be proud to know you answered the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我妻子会变成寡妇 儿子也会失去父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my wife will be a widow and my son fatherless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不期望你能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就没有家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a fam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 Josie 我不是有意这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Josie, I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人 Millie和你在一起很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man, Millie is lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些血迹怎么也洗不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…blood wouldn't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以肯定这是一起恶魔附身事件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are assuming demonic possession here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是一个语言学家突然发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a linguist gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很古老了 萨博拉语还是梵语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks ancients, Zapoqra or Sanscrit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 看起来像是古天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is pre-Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种饰章\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crest of some sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,地域骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士 他们在那里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell, what were they doing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对于那晚看到的所有事情都不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure of anything I saw that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,院长禁止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't leave our room after ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在10点之后离开卧房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother Superior forbade it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个黑暗的地方醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up in a dark place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,被绑在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tied to a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都被抓来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常害怕 不停的祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so scared, I prayed and prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是上帝没有回应我的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But god didn't answer my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Henry和Josie救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry and Josie did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hunters are always sticking your noses i.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是爱多管闲事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}In where they don't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人 拜托 我们不是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters?Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.99,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 否则他会为你的顽固付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly before this one pays for your stubbornness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是这个世界的旁观者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are perceptors, beholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录一切超自然现象的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chroniclers of all that which man does not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然是一个女学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman amongst the Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.97,0:22:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真是个惊喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't that a blust.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道我们的能耐 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know we are capable of, demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.15,0:22:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道你们自以为能对付什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know what you think you are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我应该自己去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I should see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这把老骨头换成这个梦幻小帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trading up from this bag of bones to Mr.dreamy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就能零距离的研究你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I can study you kind real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, or.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.03,0:23:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你来说更有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be more useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们总是低估女人的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}People underestimated women.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.51,0:23:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 他也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你当做妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.37,0:24:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.66,0:24:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准许你进入我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真把我逗乐了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been very entertaining, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.46,0:24:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't need your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon要什么有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon takes what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:24:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 她想要一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, she wants everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要研究那群学者了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to study the Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.63,0:24:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些烂摊子怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.20,0:24:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来之前继续演下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it going until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,装你的死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.89,0:25:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制止了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stop the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.21,0:25:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看到 她具体在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever see exactly what she was doing down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.27,0:25:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.75,0:25:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管她曾经在圣博纳文图尔做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever it was she was doing in Saint Bonaventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.07,0:25:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像又开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to be happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个修道院的名字是圣博纳文图尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The convent's name is Saint Bonaventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.45,0:25:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.19,0:25:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.06,0:25:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方已经废弃很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been closed for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.10,0:26:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这儿了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.59,0:26:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒 自动点唱机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of cold ones, a kind jukebox.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管好坏 大家一起玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good and evil, bro-in down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.44,0:26:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your piehole Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.62,0:26:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah you said that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.59,0:26:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是暗示 你是有一点害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I merely suggested you might be a bit scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.91,0:26:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我可是第一次听你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, No, I heard you the first time, you still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己都不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.02,0:26:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道Cain给了你他的印记是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Cain gave you his mark for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.43,0:26:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道你 从来没有接受印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that rather than embracing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.00,0:26:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有当这是个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather than looking at it as a gift that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.06,0:26:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而像丢了你的玩具一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sulking like you lost your knuffle bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么在抗拒你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you fighting what you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上带有该隐之印的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the chip of the old Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我猎杀都是有理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.When I kill, I kill for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.23,0:26:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟Cain不是一路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing like Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.04,0:26:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一定不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are not talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.84,0:26:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.72,0:26:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都看到了 我看到你真实的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you!I saw the true of you together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.96,0:26:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像他 你喝的什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like him?What's in that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.37,0:26:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,致幻剂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.17,0:26:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始担心你了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to worry about you Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你还是担心担心你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, why don't you worry about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.48,0:26:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你乐不乐意 我们都是一条绳上的蚂蚱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause like it or not, we are in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的麻烦就是我的麻烦 我们的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your problems, my problems, our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.77,0:27:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去浇个花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go water the lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.57,0:27:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to cross the streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.94,0:27:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很认真的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.29,0:27:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次 会轻松很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, it'll be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.95,0:27:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会习惯这种感觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get used to those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.29,0:27:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至会享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.96,0:28:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 我知道你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想去洗手间 别挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking I'd like to take a leave, so move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.40,0:28:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一眼就能认出来谁是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know a hunter when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想做你要做的这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to do what you're about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你拿着把小刀就去和恶魔决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're packing a knife to a demon fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是自寻死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.37,0:28:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也能死得光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go down swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.72,0:28:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是情况特殊 我很愿意加入你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other day I knew I'd be right there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.14,0:28:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother I would, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这回一定要听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta trust me in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种你就跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you can grow a pair, and come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.83,0:28:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前猎杀过恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've ever taken on a demon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.90,0:28:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.31,0:28:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好相信我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well trust me when I say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.59,0:28:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他把你干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he's done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回去追杀你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna go after your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,追杀你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna go after your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是你毕业晚会的舞伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell he'll go after your prom date.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.69,0:28:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你真的想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想失去每一个你爱过的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna damn anyone than anywhere you've ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.34,0:28:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能有一个非常渺茫的机会可以打赢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then a slightest chance you can win it by all means, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.86,0:28:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就去作死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹还很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a kid sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.35,0:29:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不该承受这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}She don't deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.55,0:29:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jake\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.69,0:29:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 Jake\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.90,0:30:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣博纳文图尔修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St Bonaventure Convent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.44,0:30:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔根本不需要解决生理需求的好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought demons don't take leaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你想去找人吸血的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time when you want to shoot up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.27,0:30:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个好点的理由吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you find a better excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.33,0:30:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你识破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty is charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.14,0:30:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 我以为你会想办法摆脱掉这个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?I thought you're cleaning up your act.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.98,0:30:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I was going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.91,0:30:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我做了个小小的自省\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then after a very little soul searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定正面我的人血依赖症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to embrace my addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.73,0:30:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘾君子最了解瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a junkie to know a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.49,0:30:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是想再摸摸那个宝贝不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just want to touch that precios again, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀掉Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna kill Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.60,0:30:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管初刃怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever happened to that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.78,0:30:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不用我来担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.97,0:30:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你就自我安慰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.Whatever you could tell yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.63,0:30:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你晚上就能睡个好觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can sleep better at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.55,0:30:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要什么 我害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I want, what I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that means squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.83,0:31:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我们杀死Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is the one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.37,0:31:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have to kill Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.75,0:31:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我豁出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.80,0:31:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管后果如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what the consequence is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们还是照原计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the plan remains the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到她 你把初刃带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find her, you bring the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.26,0:31:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一刹那 我以为他要识破我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second there I thought he made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.73,0:31:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心思不在这上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has other things on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.72,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他的确像你说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did do exactly what you said he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.62,0:31:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.86,0:31:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然会救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he'd save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.92,0:31:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是好闺蜜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The besties.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.13,0:31:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他终于准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.32,0:33:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂是非常宝贵又脆弱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Souls are very precious and fragile thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.10,0:33:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要打碎了罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.24,0:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂就会立刻飞回原主人身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the little buggers fly right back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不希望看到这样的画面呢 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have that now, can we.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是在帮Abaddon干这种卑鄙的勾当啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still doing Abaddon's dirty works, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.42,0:33:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agnes\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.97,0:33:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相不相信其实更卑鄙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe it's gotten even dirtier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前那么多的人都信上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be folks believed in a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.43,0:33:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧他们徘徊在这里追寻上帝的可笑样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way they come strolling in here looking for God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.48,0:33:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟瓮中捉鳖一般简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like fishing in a barrel, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.99,0:33:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿还得怪你们这群无耻之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can blame your pervert for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不得不跟一个快递员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm in some shotgun in some.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.72,0:33:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤在臭哄哄的送货车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smelly van with a handyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.67,0:33:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗一些路人甲上车 取走他们的魂儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tricking any half-wit I can lay my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这都值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.72,0:33:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为盗取灵魂很高尚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because stealing souls is so noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗取灵魂是赢家的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing souls is winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning what.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.47,0:34:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱王冠啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's crown, nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.60,0:34:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Abaddon's just gonna sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.03,0:34:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,会放任那群好吃懒做的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}While all those panty wasted demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟迟不肯决定阵营吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refuse to pick a side.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.52,0:34:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想出了个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so she made a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能说服他们妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't convince'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.71,0:34:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把灵魂转化成了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's turning souls into demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon army.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.21,0:34:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,强不可摧 只效忠于她一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbeatable, loyal only to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.32,0:34:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,照这个速度下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.23,0:34:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么也得等好几百万年才能凑齐人数吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only took a couple of millions years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.82,0:34:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.04,0:34:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是唯一一个在执行任务的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm the only doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.14,0:34:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有无数的分支\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have factories spread throughout.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.33,0:34:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 胜利近在咫尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry not though, victory is nigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.55,0:34:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we like you to be on our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.43,0:34:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,招新工作很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruitment is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.32,0:34:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要把你的灵魂从身体里剜出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to rip your soul out of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.25,0:35:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.08,0:35:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗是徒劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.36,0:35:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.94,0:37:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…uh, can I ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.16,0:37:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想约我的话 那还真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's for a date I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.66,0:37:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不跟65岁以下的人约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never see anyone under 65.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.65,0:37:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,少不了一番矫情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.36,0:37:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.98,0:37:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在亲眼目睹你做的事情后 我很疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}After witnessing what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.28,0:37:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你没有把Abaddon的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you warn Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.41,0:37:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.70,0:37:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成为一个修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became a nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.62,0:38:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了施助于众生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wanted to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.27,0:38:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界变得更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.25,0:38:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从没有人告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they never prepare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.06,0:38:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在面对世间真正邪恶的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never tell you how to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.27,0:38:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the face of true evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.73,0:38:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.07,0:38:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了所有人的安全着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the safety of all those involved, it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.41,0:38:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好对今晚发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we keep what happened here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.57,0:38:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.45,0:38:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.38,0:38:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后 我就离开了教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon after I left the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.65,0:38:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我感到羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我背叛了自己的种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had betrayed our flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.00,0:38:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是上帝 还是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.76,0:39:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这曾经是 也会一直是我最大的耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was and still is my greatest shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.52,0:39:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在的所作所为 拯救了生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what you've shared with me saved lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.04,0:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你的帮助 我一个人干不了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't have done that without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.06,0:39:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.39,0:39:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们救了那么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved lives today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.71,0:39:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚持的事业有了成效\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.21,0:39:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 我们的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, our work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.77,0:39:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无比高尚崇高的 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a noble calling, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.05,0:39:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这样做有一定的风险 但是天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yes, there's risk, but Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.70,0:40:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是份高尚的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the fool for doubting it for even a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 Josie\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?Josie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.52,0:40:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.63,0:40:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得整个人都焕然一新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I feel like a whole new person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.20,0:40:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在查资料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still plugging away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.29,0:40:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的 就像狗和骨头的关系一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a dog with a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.16,0:40:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.41,0:41:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.55,0:41:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快找到Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding Abaddon ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.48,0:41:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在收割灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mining souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.70,0:41:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.33,0:41:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造恶魔军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}To create an army.
